  ==============================================
   KickOS 0.5.1  -  microkernel RTOS
  ==============================================
   board   f302nucleo
   arch    armv7m
   cpu     cortex-m4
   mpu     off
   sched   tickless

[objbudget]   endpoint_create at the ceiling rc=-11
[objbudget] ok - a task at its endpoint ceiling is refused with the budget's own code, not ENOMEM
[objbudget] ok - and the ceiling admitted at least one endpoint first
[objbudget]   endpoint_create after closing one rc=0
[objbudget] ok - releasing an endpoint gives its budget back to the task that created it
[objbudget] skip - a task at its ceiling does not deny another task's endpoint_create: this board holds one task
[objbudget] skip - a peer's statics start from its image at every create: this board holds one task
[objbudget]   notify_create at the endpoint ceiling rc=0
[objbudget] ok - the endpoint ceiling does not refuse a notification: the count is per pool
[objbudget] PASS (4 arms)
